            },
            "reviewBody": "I made a very nice flavorful cobbler using these ingredients. Thank you for the recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2011-04-18T14:40:36.703Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Barb the Bee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good - I just used fresh fruit I had frozen from the summer - peaches, cherries, blackberries, rhubarb, and blueberries. Doubled the topping for a 9 x 13 pan as it would have been skimpy for that size pan, especially with tart rhubarb included. I used it as a side dish for brunch; guests thought it would also be great over vanilla ice cream!",
            "datePublished": "2007-09-23T16:48:28.060Z"
          }
